  "description": "I-RES is delighted to bring to market this spacious 2 - bedroom Unfurnished apartment in the sought after Tallaght Cross West Development in Tallaght, Dublin 24.\n\nApartment Features: - Dedicated Property Manager - Full time maintenance team (office hours) and emergency 24-hour maintenance service - Bright and spacious with fully fitted kitchen and bathroom - Secure underground parking available - Bicycle storage available - Monitored CCTV security systems throughout - Video entry phone systems in all units - Floor to ceiling glazing in all units, Secure fob access control system - Professionally designed and maintained private landscaped courtyards with a playground. --\nUnderground secure parking available if required, Integrated Kitchens and Modern Appliances - Separate utility room with separate generous storage.\n\nExcellent location with a host of amenities on the doorstep, Tallaght Cross West is perfectly positioned next to Tallaght Hospital, The Square Shopping Centre, and Red line Luas stops. The Institute of Technology, Tallaght, Rua Red South Dublin Arts Centre, Theatre, County Library, Civic Centre and Belgard Road are all very close by. With easy access to the M50, Business Parks at City West and Ballymount.\nTallaght is served with 17 bus routes terminating at the Square (across the street). Viewing of this apartment is highly recommended! Furniture in adverts may vary in photos.\n\nI-RES is the leading provider of quality professionally manged private residential rental accommodation in Ireland. We are committed to the highest levels of service to our residents in almost 4,000 homes in sustainable communities across Dublin. As an I-RES resident, you can be assured of: - Reliable professional service, when you need it - Fully trained staff to support you at every stage - Own inhouse maintenance team - 24-hour on-call support for emergencies such as loss of heat, water or essential services - Clear communications and point of contact via our resident portal.\n\nWe aim to reply to all emails as soon as possible, however as we receive a large number of enquiries, we may not be able to reply individually to all messages. If you do not hear from us within 48 hours, we regret that we are unable to assist you at this time. Prospect Privacy Notice: Personal data you submit in the contact form is processed by I-RES according to applicable laws and our privacy statement https://www.iresreit.ie/IRES-REIT-Privacy",
